{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"幕張メッセ握手会"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ありがとうございました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"生誕T好評だった～わーい"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"重力猫動画も見ていただけて嬉しい～"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2017/01/24/6551821/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"母が19歳の頃"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ロンドンのキングスロードにある"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Worlds Endで買ったというニットボレロ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"無理やり巻いたらマフラーにもな～る。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"色味良し形良し物持ち良し素晴らしい"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2017/01/24/6551821/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2017/01/24/6551821/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最近は掃除とお風呂がマイブームです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あとは母にいい感じの花瓶もらったので"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お花を生ける楽しみができました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あ、EX大衆で絢音ちゃんと対談してます。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"文面から伝わってくるあの距離感よ！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"キモチワルイって思われてない心配、、、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最近、激寒いこの時期に"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"玲香と夜散歩すること多いんだけど"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なかなか楽しいんだよね～"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木中でじゃんけんした時"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"設楽さんと日村さんがめっちゃ楽しそうで"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"はあ、なんて素敵なお二人！！！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"って思った、そういう瞬間おおい。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"2月4日に公開される"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"映画『傷だらけの悪魔』"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ほんの少し出演させていただきます。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"山岸聖太監督の長編映画～！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"シークレットグラフィティーMV撮影から"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"しばらくしての撮影でした、、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"関われて有難き幸せです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"漫画が映像になって更にえぐみが増し、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"生々しくて苦しくなってしまいます、、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"音といい色彩といい最高に濃ゆい。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"映画オリジナルキャラクターで"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"役名はマリコなのですが、、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「夏のせい。」を思い出すけど、、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"確実にそれだね？？！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2017/01/24/6551821/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まりか"}],"source":"archive"}